{"id":"na_o","lemma":"não","pos":"adv","rank":4,"glosses":["not; don't; haven't (negates the meaning of the verb or adverb)","used in sentences containing a negative pronoun as the object; see double negative","isn't (used to ask whether a person agrees with the proposition, rather than to ask for an unknown fact)"],"ipa":"/ˈnɐ̃w̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-n%C3%A3o.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-n%C3%A3o.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ele não irá.","en":"He will not go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67384","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]},{"text":"Não tenho casa.","en":"I have no home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/490965","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"house, home"}]},{"text":"Não tem ninguém ali.","en":"No one is there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270474","words":[null,{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"there )"}]},{"text":"Aquilo foi um não?","en":"Was that a no?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1272262","words":[{"g":"that over there, yon","l":"aquele"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Vocês não querem vir?","en":"Don't you want to come?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274394","words":[{"g":"you (pl.)"},null,{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to come"}]}]}